# QZ Tray certificate/private key pair, used for silent thermal-ticket printing.
# Generate with (see https://qz.io/docs/getting-started for the full walkthrough):
#   openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -keyout private-key.pem -out digital-certificate.txt -days 3650 -nodes
#
# Both values are PEM text (multi-line). This codebase has no prior convention
# for multi-line env values, so store them here with literal newlines escaped
# as \n — backend/src/services/printService.js unescapes them back to real
# newlines when it reads these vars at startup.
#
# Example (truncated):
# QZ_CERT_PRIVATE_KEY=-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nMIIExampleKeyData...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----
# QZ_CERT_PUBLIC=-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\nMIIExampleCertData...\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----
QZ_CERT_PRIVATE_KEY=
QZ_CERT_PUBLIC=
